ved","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:949c0f29e3801ed5c4749c59f42006c23f73944ac9c82d50393eaa92eed5a469","file":"preprints/Counterexamples-to-the-Hahn-Wilson-conjecture-at-height-two-September-26-2026/build/main.tex","line":114,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"223d6069193189840eca33ef66baaa86f49142928b6d1ebd7cf8029cddf1be59","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Counterexamples-to-the-Hahn-Wilson-conjecture-at-height-two-September-26-2026/build/main.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:949c0f29e3801ed5c4749c59f42006c23f73944ac9c82d50393eaa92eed5a469","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Counterexamples-to-the-Hahn-Wilson-conjecture-at-height-two-September-26-2026/build/main.tex#L114"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor every sufficiently large prime $p$, there is a connective\n$p$-complete spectrum $X$ of exact fp-type two such that, for a\nstandard form of $\\BP\\langle2\\rangle_p^\\wedge$,\n\\[\n X\\notin\\Thick(\\BP\\langle2\\rangle_p^\\wedge).\n\\]\nThe same spectrum satisfies\n\\[\n L_2^fX\\simeq L_2X,\n \\qquad L_{T(2)}X\\simeq L_{K(2)}X.\n\\]"}
